== Icelandic ==
{{Is-Numeral(einn)|þrjátíu og }}
===Etymology===
From ''[[þrjátíu]]'' meaning "[[thirty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[einn]]'' "[[one]]". Meaning '''thirty and one'''.
